	painsBodyHtml={`<p>The numbers are not a verdict; they are a picture of people deciding for themselves. Many Poles who have stopped attending church still hold the faith of their grandmothers, and many who attend would like to know God less as a duty and more as a Father.</p><p>That is what Scripture offers. It is free, in Polish, in Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible&trade;, for the one who has never opened it and the one who knows it by heart.</p>`}
	painsSources={[
		{ label: "GUS National Census 2021 — as reported by OKO.press", url: "https://oko.press/spis-powszechny-katolicy" },
