		{ heading: "Now in Polish", bodyHtml: "The complete Polish edition is published: <a href=\"https://fathersheartbible.com/read/pl/\" style=\"color: var(--color-brand);\" class=\"hover:underline\">read it free</a>, or see the <a href=\"/bibles/polish-bible/\" style=\"color: var(--color-brand);\" class=\"hover:underline\">print edition</a>." },
	]}
	wordHeading="His Word will not return void"
	wordBodyHtml={`<p>When our Father said, &ldquo;Let there be light,&rdquo; there was light. His Word accomplishes what He sends it to do. In a land that has printed it in Polish for more than four and a half centuries, it will not return empty.</p><p class="mt-4" style="color: var(--color-ink);">&ldquo;&hellip;so will my word be that goes out from my mouth: it will not return to me empty, but will accomplish what I desire and achieve the purpose for which I sent it.&rdquo; <span style="color: var(--color-muted);">&mdash; Isaiah 55:11</span></p>`}
